#key_features
~lazy_tree: Children fetched per expand; cached client-side
~multi_select: Checkboxes on Variable nodes (nodeClass=2) only
~no_duplicates: Skip nodes already in nodeMappings on confirm
~auto_field_name: displayName or browseName → field name in new mapping rows
~edit_mode_only: Browse button hidden when creating (no gateway ID)
